---
title: Presentation and Examination of the Candidates (Confirmation)
type: prayer
citation: BCP 415
bishop: true
bulletin: full
---

[Rubric] *The Bishop says*
[Presenters] I present *these persons* for Confirmation.
[Bishop] I present *these persons* to be received into this Communion.
[Bishop] I present *these persons* who desire to reaffirm their baptismal vows.
[Bishop] The Candidate(s) will now be presented.
[Rubric] *The Bishop asks the candidates*
[Bishop] Do you reaffirm your renunciation of evil?
[Candidate] I do.
[Bishop] Do you renew your commitment to Jesus Christ?
[Candidate] I do, and with God's grace I will follow him as my Savior and Lord.
[Rubric] *After all have been presented, the Bishop addresses the congregation, saying*
[Bishop] Will you who witness these vows do all in your power to support *these persons* in their life in Christ?
[People] **We will.**
[Rubric] *The Bishop then says these or similar words*
[Bishop] Let us join with *those* who are committing *themselves* to Christ and renew our own baptismal covenant.
